{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Rockets, Planes, Soldiers",
    "steam_appid": 2602300,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2602300/extras/b7b476bb240c24e7e19c33449eb77646.poster.avif?t=1713655719\" width=400 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2602300/extras/b7b476bb240c24e7e19c33449eb77646.webm?t=1713655719\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2602300/extras/b7b476bb240c24e7e19c33449eb77646.mp4?t=1713655719\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>A relaxing board game based on the rock-paper-scissor logic, with turn-based strategy on a hex-grid. Very simple to start playing but can get really complex and deep.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2602300/extras/e8445af693390f4ccf51b4d4e9b25c8f.poster.avif?t=1713655719\" width=690 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2602300/extras/e8445af693390f4ccf51b4d4e9b25c8f.webm?t=1713655719\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2602300/extras/e8445af693390f4ccf51b4d4e9b25c8f.mp4?t=1713655719\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>The maps are procedurally generated and you will never play the same map twice.<br><br>The basic logic always stays the same: Rocket beats Soldiers, Soldiers beats Plane and Plane beats Rockets, but you must decide on quick deploy units and attack or wait and accumulate resources before a strong push. There is also lots of upgrades that create another level of complexity as you progress into the campaign.",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2602300/extras/b7b476bb240c24e7e19c33449eb77646.poster.avif?t=1713655719\" width=400 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2602300/extras/b7b476bb240c24e7e19c33449eb77646.webm?t=1713655719\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2602300/extras/b7b476bb240c24e7e19c33449eb77646.mp4?t=1713655719\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>A relaxing board game based on the rock-paper-scissor logic, with turn-based strategy on a hex-grid. Very simple to start playing but can get really complex and deep.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2602300/extras/e8445af693390f4ccf51b4d4e9b25c8f.poster.avif?t=1713655719\" width=690 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2602300/extras/e8445af693390f4ccf51b4d4e9b25c8f.webm?t=1713655719\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2602300/extras/e8445af693390f4ccf51b4d4e9b25c8f.mp4?t=1713655719\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>The maps are procedurally generated and you will never play the same map twice.<br><br>The basic logic always stays the same: Rocket beats Soldiers, Soldiers beats Plane and Plane beats Rockets, but you must decide on quick deploy units and attack or wait and accumulate resources before a strong push. There is also lots of upgrades that create another level of complexity as you progress into the campaign.",
    "short_description": "Rock-paper-scissors's logic in a tabletop board with a hexgrid. A turn-based strategy game that starts simple enough to be instantly enjoyable but evolves into a challenging tactics based campaign in which every new unlock and every next battle has to be planned.",
    "supported_languages": "English",
